Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.96,0:00:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.98,0:00:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world\Nbelieving that surely someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.06,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up, way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.26,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on. Never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if brains\Nare rubbed up to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami's been kidnapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my fault, they were huge,\Nbut I never saw them coming
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They showed up out of nowhere,\Nattacked, then they left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,First it was centaurs,\Nnow we've got giants too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.94,0:02:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of messed up island is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,An ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So they were tracking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That means they're professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.58,0:02:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So they didn't come to save Gatorbeard?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:03:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems they wanted to kill us\Nand take the children back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But then their master, he\Nmade them kill Brownbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They were on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Brownbeard was so loyal, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master wouldn't harm children.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a one-hearted savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know much about this Master guy,\Nbut there are two things I'm sure of.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That he's evil and he's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows what he'll do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not the only problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.02,0:03:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami's still trapped in Frankie's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really worried about her, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll save her somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.77,0:03:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you look after the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.96,0:03:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.87,0:03:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my body they took.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, I can't\Nfight in this rat suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me one of those magic beans\Nthat turns you into a badass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And make it quick, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What bean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.97,0:03:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, the rumble ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's a drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on the first try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.56,0:03:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a super-powered cyborg\Nwith the heart of a champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hand over the goods, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.34,0:04:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have a lot of time to\Nsit here and argue about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, that thing will\Nmake you a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,After just three minutes,\Nyou'll be worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to do Kong fu point\Nlike I did earlier and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Way too early!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Franky, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.32,0:04:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to squish me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricky! I told you! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.90,0:04:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should've had him stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dangerous right now, but\Nonce the rumble ball wears off,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll be too weak to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll be useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where he got it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But this cyborg Franky fellow\Nappears to have Vegapunk's laser.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,weapon attached to his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,After I cut that garish robot to\Npieces and extract the laser system,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,his body will be nothing but a\Nworthless pile of scrap metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.56,0:05:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the incinerator. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those would be ship thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.14,0:05:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the ones from the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle's raging out of control now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we're having trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.02,0:05:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:05:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This will do nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the Navy will make\Nexcellent test subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a golden opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.74,0:06:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact all the centaurs\Ncurrently on patrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Better make it quick. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell our soldiers to evacuate at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless they want to die, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.96,0:06:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Perverts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your filthy paws to\Nyourself, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I understand that\NI'm cute and voluptuous,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.14,0:06:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and you wanted me all to yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.26,0:06:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.60,0:06:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, whatever he's\Ninto, it's cool with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this, jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait until Luffy gets here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.80,0:06:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll kick your hairy\Nbutts into next week!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.48,0:07:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Noisy prisoners are...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.62,0:07:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.62,0:07:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, the laser\Nweapon built into your body is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And the reward for bringing\Nit to our master will be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.32,0:07:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.34,0:07:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This wind is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost too cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get some clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.58,0:07:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To someone your size,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,a shot from one of our rifles is\Nlike being hit by a cannonball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And these are filled with poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Our targets never see it coming either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As for your friend, of course he'll\Ncome. We set a trap to lure him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,here he won't be able to resist\Nfollowing giant footprints in the snow
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,sweet giant footprints\Nin the snow how easily
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,i should follow them this is way too easy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit it, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.40,0:08:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I gotta tell you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.50,0:08:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's no more footprints!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy and Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.96,0:08:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, that's Franky! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.82,0:08:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Their foe's hiding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Scotch? Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty Uncle of him not\Nto notice the cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those spikes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.32,0:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a cool way to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.20,0:09:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Armament! Hard name!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.68,0:09:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he's a bit trickier than the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.66,0:09:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh told me it's a waste to\Njust use this move for defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, what did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shake the bullets and send them all\Nright back to him twice as hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Kuma, Kuma, fire the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay off, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got bigger problems here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.58,0:10:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.48,0:10:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They might lose their cool,\Nbut I won't lose mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The cool thing about mountains is\Nthey can be turned into weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.06,0:10:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The top of that nut's falling on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.66,0:10:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't be breaking heads up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get away in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.86,0:10:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All it takes is one of\Nthese KYP canisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll fall into a drunken stupor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,just like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Frank, you did something useful!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.12,0:11:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.20,0:11:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're getting it! Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back to this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Elephant God!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You went straight to\Nthat trick of the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.44,0:11:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Chopper's buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.92,0:11:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get Chopper to fix you up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.81,0:11:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you before we have the\Nhome-filled advantage in these mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give up. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.62,0:11:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.94,0:11:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can reach a lot higher than you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.82,0:12:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's not kidding, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose him in these mountains,\NI'll never track him down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Trafalgar Law, the famous freeloader.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool, I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy should be right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Rune.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:12:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.86,0:13:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't cool at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.00,0:13:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, counter-shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Agh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.04,0:13:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, change me back, creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.24,0:13:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.04,0:13:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for saving Nami, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.42,0:14:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, here's the thing, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here because there's\Nsomething I want to discuss with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume you landed on\NPunk Hazard by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.62,0:14:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's an important\Nkey hiding on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,One that's powerful enough to throw\Nthe new world into total chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, there are only two\Nways to live in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting under the umbrella
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,of the four emperors or\Nfighting against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And you don't strike me\Nas the type who likes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,to work under someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right, I'm captain. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.56,0:14:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can work with me, huh? Like how us two
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,will take down one of the four emperors
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a good plan. So tell
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,me so
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,let me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,get this straight
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We meet by chance on this crazy island,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and you ask us if we want to\Nfight an emperor out of the blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know what this sleazeball\Nis after, but I don't trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's up to no good, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying killing off\Nan emperor will be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.86,0:15:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I just think our odds will be better if we
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,work together and plan\Neverything step by step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your big chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's four of them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.02,0:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't team up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of our target.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, got it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.12,0:16:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.85,0:16:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Team up with the heart, pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.96,0:16:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,how did you manage to go completely insane\Nin the time you were out saving Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.14,0:16:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you weren't\Neven gone for that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.34,0:16:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This psycho already\Nscared the crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we have to trust him with our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.12,0:16:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now am I supposed to sleep\Nat night with him around?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:16:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just forget it. It's risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why nobody is on board with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better for us to do\Nthings that are opaque.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.64,0:17:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.02,0:17:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's way too early to think\Nabout challenging the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.52,0:17:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just not ready yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.84,0:17:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fix this raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Raccoons aren't important right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.44,0:17:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I will go along with\Nthis, but we are all pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And where you have pirates, well,\Nyou're sure to have betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you going to betray me? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.36,0:17:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of us are going\Nto need more than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate alliance sounds\Nlike a lot of fun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My gut says Traffy's an okay guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.84,0:17:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if he's not, what's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys were training\Nfor the past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.62,0:18:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.22,0:18:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, now I'm flushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.50,0:18:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm super flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.06,0:18:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise we won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're only awesome because it's our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to let her up, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, don't worry, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, we've got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.88,0:18:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And hey, even if these other wimps\Nchicken out, you've always got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.82,0:18:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it's good to be back in my own body!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost nobody else I'd rather be than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:18:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're back. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.58,0:19:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't ever take possession\Nof Chopper's body again. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's all busted up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't have killed you big jerks\Nto be a little more careful with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all Frankie's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who turned into\Na monster and flipped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.04,0:19:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All I did was stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With that same overpowered move you used\Nto beat that kraken, that was overkill!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, you're both jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.86,0:19:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least you got\Nyour own bodies back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I the only person\Nwithout my own body?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.64,0:19:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even funnier this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My good dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm glad you're\Nenjoying it! Stop laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.06,0:19:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But it had to be you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper and Franky were\Nboth in the same place
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.22,0:20:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,when our scary new friends\Nswitched everyone back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.42,0:20:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But since Sanji took your body with him\Nwhen he went looking for the samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.02,0:20:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,your heart had nowhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you're gonna be mad at\Nsomeone, it should be Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you not until your body comes back
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So they're all here,\Nmm—hmm, we gotta help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,just forget about them too much work;
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,all of them are addicted to\Ndrugs, yeah, we know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I tested them for kids; I want\Nto take them all back home,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.54,0:20:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but they need to recover\Nand build up their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.38,0:20:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if we can do anything\Nabout their size—it's sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would do this to a\Nbunch of little kids? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the world government for one—for\Nhundreds of years now they've
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,been conducting experiments to\Ntry and turn people into giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.26,0:20:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The government, but why would\Nthey do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:21:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had to take a guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.64,0:21:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'd say it's to\Ncreate unlimited giant
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,soldiers—it's hard to\Nbeat an army like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar's probably hoping to figure\Nout how to do. out how to do
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.44,0:21:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,at first, so he can beat Vegapunk\Nand the government to the punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,it's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.89,0:21:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you want to help them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you don't even know\Nwho these kids are, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.62,0:21:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, they may be strangers to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But they looked
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.70,0:21:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,at me with tears in their\Neyes, begging for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master was able to trick them\Ninto coming to this terrible place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.34,0:21:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But once they got here, it\Ndidn't take too long for
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.48,0:21:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,them to realize that\Nsomething wasn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make sure\Nevery single one of them is
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,safe and sound, and I won't\Nleave this island until I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.96,0:21:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I leave with Luffy, are\Nyou going to stay here alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.40,0:21:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.28,0:22:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is important to\NNami and Chopper, then I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,stay too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.09,0:22:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And Sanji wants to put\Nthat samurai back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.00,0:22:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if you're going to work With\Nus then, get used to helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.46,0:22:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea what you're\Ngetting into here, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.00,0:22:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the thing: see most of the\Ntime when you're forming an alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.22,0:22:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you have a couple of\Ngroups with a common goal
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.14,0:22:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and you negotiate the\Nbest way to get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.04,0:22:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that sound right, obviously?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.14,0:22:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think, but in Luffy's world that\Nlogic gets thrown out the window completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.72,0:22:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just means I'm friends\Nwith you frankly—you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.78,0:22:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,could forget about having\Nany say in what we.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.63,0:22:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.62,0:22:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as this guy makes up his\Nmind about something, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.10,0:22:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're along for the ride\Nwhether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If selfishness was a power,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,he'd take out that emperor on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.94,0:22:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you stand me? Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that this is\Nwhat your friends want,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.16,0:22:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't concern our planet. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:22:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop flicking your boogers at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.04,0:23:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.30,0:23:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wipe it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.34,0:23:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move right now,\Nremember? Right, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.06,0:23:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, but we have to hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.52,0:23:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Putting the samurai back together\Ncan be your group's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.60,0:23:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess I can go investigate the\Ndrug that was given to the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now who's the ship's doctor again?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.48,0:23:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.68,0:23:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do research behind Caesar's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.96,0:23:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There, that should do it. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.60,0:23:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just, I can't walk right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.08,0:23:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.28,0:23:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a lot of hats, Draghi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.60,0:23:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for laughing, but I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.34,0:23:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful out there, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.52,0:23:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.62,0:23:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,As you could probably all tell\Nfrom those assassins he sent,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.66,0:24:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar wants to eliminate you, as\Nwell as White Hunter and the G5,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.18,0:24:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,so he can take the children back;
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.02,0:24:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,he's not gonna stop pursuing you,\Nnot until he gets what he's after.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.38,0:24:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the incident four years\Nago when he became a criminal,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.48,0:24:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,he was a government scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.36,0:24:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Punk hazard is restricted territory;
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,if word gets out that\Nsomeone's been living here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.08,0:24:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,then Caesar will be forced\Nto leave his perfect hideout;
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.80,0:24:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,that's why he'll stop at nothing to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.78,0:24:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.69,0:24:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a guy with a\Nbounty of 300 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did he eat the Logia-type
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.82,0:24:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gas-Gas fruit. He's also got\Nweapons of mass destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.82,0:24:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar Clown is a force\Nto be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.00,0:24:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,300 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.92,0:24:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Those of you who can't use\NHaki should steer clear of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.20,0:24:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's extremely tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.12,0:24:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we do have some Haki users.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.48,0:24:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's me, Zoro, and Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.86,0:24:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.80,0:24:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.64,0:25:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll head over to the lab now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.40,0:25:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful out there. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.70,0:25:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're supposed to kidnap\Nthis master guy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.18,0:25:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the quickest way to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.90,0:25:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.26,0:25:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what good will it do us to kidnap\NCaesar? Money? Oh, no. That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.42,0:25:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar's their boss. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.76,0:25:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There wouldn't be anybody\Nto pay his ransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.34,0:25:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What we're after is chaos, not money. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.40,0:25:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaos?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.50,0:25:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.88,0:25:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No point in explaining this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.88,0:25:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can worry about what lies\Nahead when the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.20,0:25:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For right now, it's better to\Nfocus on capturing Caesar Clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.44,0:25:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.54,0:25:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as that's done, I'll explain\Nthe whole plan to you in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.48,0:25:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.46,0:25:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,once we get our hands on Caesar, that's\Ngoing to set everything in motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.28,0:25:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.72,0:25:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.50,0:25:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Last chance to change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.32,0:26:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.60,0:26:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.80,0:26:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still with you. Well, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.44,0:26:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm more than willing\Nto cooperate with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.68,0:26:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You just need to make sure\Nyour crew's on board, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.04,0:26:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.38,0:26:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.86,0:26:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.16,0:26:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Freebar Smoothie,\Nand Fenbok of the Gourd.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.10,0:26:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Rope-tugging Chopper, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.18,0:26:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so. These people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.34,0:26:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As it turns out, they're\Nall former prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.92,0:26:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They just look a little bit different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.82,0:26:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.50,0:26:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.00,0:26:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The report said everyone was killed\Nduring the incident four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.70,0:27:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.61,0:27:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do they all look like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.30,0:27:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.56,0:27:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gives a damn what they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.66,0:27:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep holding them back, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.46,0:27:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't send out a signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.12,0:27:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we get to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.78,0:27:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.88,0:27:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, do you have a call?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.98,0:27:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.89,0:27:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, let it ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.56,0:27:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's something\Nalong the lines of we
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.40,0:27:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,opened the door and something\Nterrible was inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.38,0:27:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's killing our comrades left and right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.72,0:27:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Master, please help us, etc., etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.10,0:27:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I want to listen to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.60,0:27:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined this island would\Nbe graced with so many visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.00,0:27:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to collect\Nany more test subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.78,0:28:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello! Master! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.76,0:28:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, pick up quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.88,0:28:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We did what you told us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.60,0:28:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We opened up that big\Ndoor in the Burning Lands!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.82,0:28:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No good!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.92,0:28:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master won't answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.22,0:28:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.38,0:28:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's catching up to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.96,0:28:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.87,0:28:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How far can that crazy thing run?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.68,0:28:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I don't want\Nto die like everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.44,0:29:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.74,0:29:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing's so huge, we're\Nnever going to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.62,0:29:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.90,0:29:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.84,0:29:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.40,0:29:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.28,0:29:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know my pet, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.62,0:30:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rare specimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.64,0:30:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Its body is made of deadly slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.94,0:30:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.08,0:30:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be a bit much, but I can't\Nallow anyone to leave this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.92,0:30:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it feel to be\Nset free after so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.66,0:30:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Smiley!
